  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.4: README fixes - the order return_url/cancel_url redirect gap and CLI documentation alignment; also clarified that the CLI's own order-testing flow has no return_url by design (no running web app to redirect to). No code changes. 1.2.3: Realigned the package version with the repo's git tag numbering (and with the other two packages, which now share the same version). No code changes. 1.1.1: Expanded the README's Sandbox payment walkthrough for the 'order' command. No code changes. 1.1.0: Added 'order create/get/capture' commands - create, fetch, and capture a real Order directly from the terminal, resolving credentials from flags, PAYPAL_* environment variables, or an appsettings.json 'init' already wrote. 1.0.1: Fixed the #:package directive version used when setting up a file-based app - it was pinned to 1.0.0, now matches the current PayPal.PartnerGateway release (1.0.1). 1.0.0: Initial release - 'init' and 'detect' commands with automatic project-framework detection.",
